# Lys Alana Dignitary, "behold an Elf or pay {2}": with an Elvish Mystic in hand Bot1 may still pay {2} instead (CR 601.2b), and then nothing is
# beheld or revealed. Bot1 floats exactly {G}{G}{G}{G} from Black Lotus and a Forest, which pays {1}{G} and the {2}, and the pool is empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Lys Alana Dignitary
Elvish Mystic
Forest x3
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lys Alana Dignitary.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Pay {2})
! Bot1.Choose
? Bot1.Mana =

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
